-- 03_visa_requirements.sql
-- Baseline status for every origin -> destination pair in scope (329 rows).
-- Rebuilt on 2026-11-25. This file REPLACES all rows in visa_requirements: the previous version
-- contained rows marked detailed = true / verified that were not backed by official sources.
--
-- How each row was produced:
--   data_source = 'manual'          Status checked against the destination government's official
--                                   list (UK visa-national and ETA lists, US Visa Waiver Program,
--                                   Canada eTA list, EU visa-exempt list, Saudi eVisa portal,
--                                   Japan MOFA exemption list, China NIA / MFA notices, UAE MOFA/ICP).
--                                   last_verified and source_url are set.
--   detailed = TRUE                 Only for visa-required pairs into destinations whose visa
--                                   template (02_visa_types.sql) is fully verified: US, GB, CA, DE, CH.
--                                   The sitemap lists only these pairs.
-- Overrides (fees, apply_url, max_stay_days, and the Saudi embassy-visa steps) are set only where an official source supports them.
-- Requires migrations 001 and 002 and seed files 01 and 02.

